    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You let out a piercing yip that sends your friends charging in. As a Bonus Action, choose a point within 10 feet of you. Until the start of your next turn, you and your allies have Advantage on attack rolls against any enemy within 10 feet of that point that can hear you. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
